# 🏗️ Project Lifecycle

## PRDs Required
- New features: `prds/{feature}.md`
- YAML frontmatter: title, created, status, owner, log

## PRD Sections
- Problem, Business Context, Goals & KPIs
- Personas/Journeys, Requirements (functional + non-functional)
- Data & Integrations, Open Questions
- Risks & Mitigations, Success Metrics
- Rollout Plan, Next Steps

## Maintenance
- Keep PRDs current (status, requirements, decisions, log)
- Link to shipped artifacts
- Mark deprecated features with `@deprecated` comment
- Provide migration paths
- Document breaking changes in `CHANGELOG.md`
